---
/**
 * bm-item-orjejj — TRANSLATED Bricksmaven skeleton.
 * Produced by bricks_translate.py from the ACSS payload
 * beside this file (item-orjejj.json). Bank source, NOT a gold
 * exemplar: the SOP adapts props/copy/rhythm before
